area-6.ESO11.questions.Q8.text:
What information is collected and reported during the vulnerability disclosure and reporting process?
In particular, how are the following aspects addressed (if at all)?
– The nature, severity, and potential impact of the vulnerability;
– Any known or suspected exploitation by malicious actors;
– The security updates or other mitigation measures implemented in response.

area-6.ESO11.questions.Q9.text:
Does the reporting procedures, incident final report templates include gathering and reporting at least the following data:
(i) a detailed description of the incident, including its severity and impact;
(ii) the type of threat or root cause that is likely to have triggered the incident;
(iii) applied and ongoing mitigation measures?
